# Environment variables for prompt-pro
#
# The only runnable code in this repo is the weather MCP server under
# segments/segment-4-agentic-orchestration/mcp-demos/weather-server/.
# It calls the public US National Weather Service API and needs NO API key.
#
# Optional: if you extend the demos to call OpenAI, copy this file to .env
# and set your own key. Never commit real secrets.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
